                <rect x='60' y='404' width='560' height='52' rx='8' fill='#FFF8E1' stroke='#FFC107' strokeWidth='2' />
                <text x='340' y='427' fill='#1A2230' font-size='17' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>卷积把"局部性、平移等变"写进了结构（归纳偏置）</text>
                <text x='340' y='448' fill='#1E4FA8' font-size='17' font-weight='bold' text-anchor='middle' font-family='Microsoft YaHei'>注意力什么都没假设，代价是必须自己从数据里学出来</text>
